# Bug hunt round 1 (trains): a long seated ride (three minutes, through stations, over chunk borders), in survival.
# The train keeps every car, he stays seated, takes no harm, and the game keeps its pace.
stream on
train at station
survival on
ride nearest train
expect riding == 1
tick 180
print train
print player
print fps
expect riding == 1
expect train.cars >= 3
expect player.health >= 20
expect player.inblock == 0
expect fps.worst < 60
